  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Stolen unrestrained heavenly marks form a heaven path immortal material. Fang Yuan takes that material and activates the food path killer move Devour Heaven and Earth, a method made to devour heaven path immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        2133
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "from-heavenly-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_devour_heaven_and_earth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After consuming a heaven path immortal material, Fang Yuan’s sovereign immortal aperture gains nine more heaven path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        2134
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "consumed-for-dao-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Paradise Earth lacked heavenly secret Immortal Gu, so he used heavenly web Gu as the core with a large amount of heaven path immortal materials. After those materials are used, Fang Yuan’s body gains a new layer of heaven path dao marks resembling a fishing net. The more heaven path immortal materials he consumes, the more heaven path dao marks build that net, and obscured heavenly secret becomes stronger and longer lasting.",
      "chapters": [
        2229
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "obscured-heavenly-secret",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_heavenly_web_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Activating heavenly secret Gu needs immortal essence and also expends heaven path immortal materials. Without using those materials the Gu can still activate, but the amount needed for the next activation rises much higher. Fang Yuan does not lack heaven path immortal materials, because abundant ones appear when the two heavens fuse together.",
      "chapters": [
        2275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "two-heavens-fusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
